            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Audrey Lalonde"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a very enjoyable meal, but pimped the recipe just a bit. I added some cumin seeds and asafoetida, roasted them prior to the onions, and used only one bird green chili and it was just enough to my taste. Also added some heavy cream at the end of the cooking to add a creamy side to the dish. \n\nMy split uraad daal took more time to cook, maybe 45-55 minutes even if I soaked them for at least 4 hours.\n\nI accompanied this with a pulao rice. It was great! Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2019-04-18T00:37:37.557Z"
          },
